# Second Brain — privacy defaults
#
# The whole point: you can version the SYSTEM without ever committing your LIFE.
# The filled-in files below are ignored by default. Templates (*.template.md)
# are NOT ignored — those are safe to share.

# Your real identity and memory files (filled-in versions)
/USER.md
/SOUL.md
/AGENTS.md
/MEMORY.md
/taste-profile.md

# Daily logs — your actual days are nobody's business
/memory/*.md
!/memory/daily-log.md

# Real people and group pages (templates stay tracked)
/memory/people/*.md
!/memory/people/INDEX.md
!/memory/people/person-example.md
/memory/groups/*.md

# Audit ledgers hold real promises and real names
/audits/*.md
!/audits/promise-audit.md

# Anything else personal you add later
/private/
*.private.md

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
